WEBVTT

1
00:00:52.668 --> 00:00:54.308
Hey Sophia. it's me.

2
00:00:55.548 --> 00:00:57.748
You never answer your phone.

3
00:00:57.748 --> 00:00:59.388
I wanted to talk to you before I leave.

4
00:00:59.388 --> 00:01:00.828
Your sponsor called me.

5
00:01:00.828 --> 00:01:02.268
She says she hasn't been to your meetings...

6
00:01:03.708 --> 00:01:06.268
I'm worried about you.

7
00:01:06.268 --> 00:01:09.428
I'm going to be spending the night
at the observatory.

8
00:01:09.428 --> 00:01:10.948
Call me. please.

9
00:13:28.708 --> 00:13:30.068
Doctor? Colonel Mokrani.

10
00:13:30.068 --> 00:13:32.988
I'm your military liaison.

11
00:13:32.988 --> 00:13:34.028
Nice to meet you.

12
00:13:35.428 --> 00:13:36.628
What just happened in there?

13
00:13:38.948 --> 00:13:40.428
You scared them.

14
00:15:55.508 --> 00:15:56.508
Do you ski?

15
00:15:58.308 --> 00:15:59.668
What? Do I ski?

16
00:15:59.668 --> 00:16:00.428
Yes.

17
00:16:00.428 --> 00:16:02.148
You work in the mountains...

18
00:16:02.148 --> 00:16:03.588
So I was thinking...

19
00:16:03.588 --> 00:16:04.868
It's possible.

20
00:16:04.868 --> 00:16:06.428
Ah. I used to.

21
00:16:07.588 --> 00:16:08.268
Not for a long time.

22
00:16:12.948 --> 00:16:13.908
You okay?

23
00:16:13.908 --> 00:16:14.708
Yes.

24
00:16:16.708 --> 00:16:17.868
I hate these things.

25
00:16:33.788 --> 00:16:35.668
My men are here to secure the site.

26
00:16:35.668 --> 00:16:38.108
You must tell me if we get
in the way of your work.

27
00:16:38.108 --> 00:16:39.388
Don't worry. I will.

28
00:19:02.788 --> 00:19:04.068
The bill. please.

29
00:19:11.548 --> 00:19:13.508
Come on. Sophia. Answer your phone.

30
00:19:31.028 --> 00:19:32.028
What's going on?

31
00:21:37.508 --> 00:21:39.548
What's going on?

32
00:21:39.548 --> 00:21:41.468
Multiple objects are approaching Earth.

33
00:21:43.868 --> 00:21:44.908
What sort of objects?

34
00:21:44.908 --> 00:21:46.348
We don't know.

35
00:21:46.348 --> 00:21:49.028
They're travelling at more than
a thousand kilometers per second.

36
00:21:49.028 --> 00:21:50.228
That's impossible.

37
00:22:26.348 --> 00:22:27.748
They're losing speed.

38
00:22:28.828 --> 00:22:31.348
They're slowing down as they enter
the Earth's atmosphere.

39
00:22:32.948 --> 00:22:34.108
Do you think it's an...

40
00:22:35.348 --> 00:22:36.428
...an attack?

41
00:23:07.868 --> 00:23:09.468
Impact in 80 seconds.

42
00:23:31.868 --> 00:23:33.908
Impact in ten seconds...

43
00:23:36.708 --> 00:23:41.468
...six. five. four. three. two...

44
00:23:58.068 --> 00:23:59.508
Reports of multiple impacts...

45
00:24:01.588 --> 00:24:03.388
Initial assessments

46
00:24:03.388 --> 00:24:05.348
suggest the damage is localised...

47
00:24:07.068 --> 00:24:09.068
Saaid. prepare the reports on the impacts
every ten minutes.

48
00:24:09.068 --> 00:24:09.868
Yes. sir.

49
00:24:09.868 --> 00:24:11.908
On all the sites.

50
00:25:14.788 --> 00:25:16.868
Hey. little sister.

51
00:25:16.868 --> 00:25:18.828
I wanted to see if you're okay.

52
00:25:18.828 --> 00:25:20.948
I know you don't want to speak to me.

53
00:25:20.948 --> 00:25:21.988
Just text me

54
00:25:24.428 --> 00:25:26.588
to tell me you're okay.

55
00:25:26.588 --> 00:25:27.668
Please.

56
00:27:13.268 --> 00:27:14.948
Fuck! Answer your phone! Shit!

57
00:27:20.508 --> 00:27:22.148
Why do you keep calling me?

58
00:27:24.868 --> 00:27:27.508
I know things are bad between us...

59
00:27:27.508 --> 00:27:29.908
I think you should come
and stay at the observatory.

60
00:27:29.908 --> 00:27:31.028
Why?

61
00:27:31.028 --> 00:27:32.428
It's safer here.

62
00:27:33.588 --> 00:27:35.948
Do you think these things are dangerous?

63
00:27:35.948 --> 00:27:38.108
I don't know. I don't know.

64
00:27:38.108 --> 00:27:40.068
Please...

65
00:27:40.068 --> 00:27:40.868
Come here.

66
00:27:42.108 --> 00:27:43.748
For once. trust me.

67
00:27:45.228 --> 00:27:47.388
But I don't understand.
Tell me what's happening.

68
00:27:47.388 --> 00:27:49.428
You have petrol in your car?

69
00:27:49.428 --> 00:27:50.828
Yes.

70
00:27:50.828 --> 00:27:52.028
Tell me what's happening.

71
00:27:52.028 --> 00:27:54.028
Don't take anything with you. just leave.

72
00:27:54.028 --> 00:27:54.748
Now.

73
00:27:54.748 --> 00:27:57.148
Catherine. I don't understand.
You're scaring me.

74
00:27:57.148 --> 00:28:01.028
Sophia. Sophia. I beg you.

75
00:28:02.068 --> 00:28:03.268
Okay.

76
00:30:25.908 --> 00:30:29.548
The first samples show
at least four unknown elements.

77
00:30:30.868 --> 00:30:32.908
What's generating the electromagnetic field?

78
00:30:33.908 --> 00:30:37.268
All we know is that the frequency
and amplitude are continuing to increase.

79
00:30:39.108 --> 00:30:42.628
We send probes to other planets
to study them. It's logical...

80
00:30:43.708 --> 00:30:45.108
...that they might do the same to us.

81
00:30:46.668 --> 00:30:48.748
Why send so many?

82
00:30:48.748 --> 00:30:50.948
And why are they clustered
around population centres?

83
00:30:55.148 --> 00:30:56.828
The original signal.

84
00:30:58.308 --> 00:31:00.748
We picked it up during
one rotation of the Earth.

85
00:31:02.148 --> 00:31:03.028
And?

86
00:31:03.028 --> 00:31:05.828
It was the time needed to make
a complete scan of our planet.

87
00:31:05.828 --> 00:31:08.068
They were mapping us?

88
00:31:10.508 --> 00:31:12.388
Do you think we should destroy them?

89
00:31:14.308 --> 00:31:15.348
They could be weapons.

90
00:31:15.348 --> 00:31:17.628
The pictures from Wyoming.

91
00:31:20.028 --> 00:31:21.388
Have a look.

92
00:31:21.388 --> 00:31:24.628
An F16 dropped a one tonne bomb
on one of them.

93
00:31:24.628 --> 00:31:26.148
Direct hit and not even a scratch.

94
00:34:51.388 --> 00:34:52.708
The train station. please!

95
00:34:52.708 --> 00:34:54.348
No. no. I'm not working.

96
00:37:44.108 --> 00:37:45.588
What is that?

97
00:37:45.588 --> 00:37:48.988
It's the effect of the electromagnetic field
on the atmosphere.

98
00:37:52.108 --> 00:37:54.348
The British government has issued
a warning of an imminent attack.

99
00:39:15.308 --> 00:39:17.028
Where are you?

100
00:39:17.028 --> 00:39:19.748
On the road through the valley.
I'm stuck in traffic.

101
00:39:19.748 --> 00:39:21.108
Listen to me.

102
00:39:21.108 --> 00:39:22.988
There's going to be an attack.

103
00:39:22.988 --> 00:39:24.228
You have to find somewhere to take shelter.

104
00:39:24.228 --> 00:39:25.388
What do you mean. an attack?

105
00:39:25.388 --> 00:39:28.108
I don't know. you need
to find shelter underground.

106
00:39:29.428 --> 00:39:30.428
Just go!

107
00:39:30.428 --> 00:39:32.468
There's nowhere to go!

108
00:42:04.428 --> 00:42:06.548
I'm sorry for being such a screw up...

109
00:42:06.548 --> 00:42:08.148
Don't say that. It's not true.

110
00:42:08.148 --> 00:42:09.308
I never phone you back.

111
00:42:09.308 --> 00:42:10.588
I'm a screw up.

112
00:42:10.588 --> 00:42:11.548
You're always there for me.

113
00:42:11.548 --> 00:42:12.548
Don't say that.

114
00:42:12.548 --> 00:42:15.668
- You've got to get underground.
- But there's nowhere.

115
00:42:15.668 --> 00:42:17.548
- Just go!
- The things I said to you. I'm sorry.

116
00:42:17.548 --> 00:42:19.388
You've got to find an underground shelter.
Now! Go!

117
00:42:19.388 --> 00:42:20.628
There's nothing! There's nowhere to go.

118
00:42:23.868 --> 00:42:25.508
We've lost contact with our planes.

119
00:42:25.508 --> 00:42:27.628
They're falling like flies.

120
00:42:30.988 --> 00:42:32.108
Something is happening.

121
00:42:44.908 --> 00:42:45.908
What's happening?

122
00:42:49.948 --> 00:42:51.548
We need a connection. Quick!

123
00:42:51.548 --> 00:42:52.428
Everyone take shelter.

124
00:45:07.628 --> 00:45:09.588
Make sure all the doors stay closed.

125
00:45:11.588 --> 00:45:12.908
You think it's all over?

126
00:45:12.908 --> 00:45:14.308
I don't know.

127
00:45:14.308 --> 00:45:15.468
Everyone!

128
00:45:15.468 --> 00:45:17.508
Save your batteries...

129
00:45:17.508 --> 00:45:18.548
...switch off your torches.
